{"id": "EUVD-2026-104193", "enisaUuid": "1c9e4efb-6a2e-3918-aa88-83df49b6575b", "description": "Use of Externally-Controlled Input to Select Classes or Code ('Unsafe Reflection') vulnerability in Apache Johnzon.\n\n\n\nClassConverter loads & static-initializes an attacker-named class from untrusted JSON.\n\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Johnzon: from 1.0.0 before 2.2.0.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 1.3.1 (javax namespace) or 2.2.0 (jakarta specification namespace), which fixes the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T10:36:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T19:34:25", "baseScore": 9.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://github.com/apache/johnzon/commit/dd3d00634c746a2173a2518e882e85e8a151bf30", "https://github.com/apache/johnzon/commit/91e7b0d21d08d138944e2570691939739422a3d6", "https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/3vgm1yo2sn9yhkvvs9lc4ro01vl3zt68"], "aliases": ["GHSA-66gj-8qvf-qvfh", "CVE-2026-71253"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.65, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6820b288-c728-378f-b04c-204666768571", "product": {"name": "Apache Johnzon", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.2.0"}, {"id": "6ee56f74-5ff7-359b-91b2-7c6c3d2c06bb", "product": {"name": "Apache Johnzon", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "1.0.0 <1.3.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e67b1d03-007d-32ce-ba6b-c46e0a9c64f4", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}